  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of coconut oil in a large clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the grated aubergine and cook until it starts to soften, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chili flakes, cumin powder, coriander powder, and salt. Stir well to combine.",
    "Add the ketchup and stir to combine. Bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the tagine simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the sugar and cook for another 5 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
  ],
